Rahul: Set up the Python backend project, initialize GitHub repository, and configure PostgreSQL database connection (Backend)
Sharon: Design the archive database schema and create tables for articles, interviews, and footage notes (Backend)
Reshma: Create the React project, install Tailwind CSS, and set up the basic folder structure and routing (Frontend)

Day 2 Tasks

Rahul: Implement secure user authentication with login API and password hashing (Backend)
Sharon: Create sample archive data and write database scripts to populate PostgreSQL (Backend)
Reshma: Design and build the login page and application layout with navigation (Frontend)

Day 3 Tasks

Rahul: Develop database models and API endpoints for archive document retrieval (Backend)
Sharon: Test database connectivity and optimize sample data organization (Backend)
Reshma: Build the dashboard page and create the search interface design (Frontend)

